    <string name="setup_hint">How to get the address:\n1. Open cc-haha desktop app on your computer\n2. Settings → H5 Access → enable “Enable H5 access”\n3. Tap “Generate token” — a QR code appears on screen\n4. Tap “Scan QR” below to scan it, or tap “Copy launch URL” and paste it above\n\nTap an address to connect; long-press to rename or delete.\nNote: phone and computer must be on the same Wi-Fi. The link contains a token — treat it like a password.</string>
